---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Flu Prevention Guide — Vaccines, Hygiene, Immune Support"
  description="Evidence-based guide to preventing influenza. Flu vaccine information, hygiene practices, immune system support, and protecting your family during flu season."
>
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <header class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-teal-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Prevention Hub</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-navy-900 mt-2 mb-4">
        How to Prevent the Flu
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
        The best defense is prevention. Learn about flu vaccines, hygiene habits, and evidence-based strategies to protect yourself and your loved ones.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="infographic max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6">
      <img src="/images/shield.svg" alt="Flu prevention shield illustration" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <a href="/prevention/flu-vaccine-guide/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💉</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu Vaccine Guide</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Everything you need to know about the flu shot: effectiveness, types, timing, and who should get it.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Read guide →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/prevention/flu-shot-myths/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">❓</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Flu Shot Myths vs. Facts</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Debunking common flu vaccine misconceptions with evidence. "Can the flu shot give you the flu?" and more.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Check the facts →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/prevention/hygiene-habits/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🧼</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Hygiene & Prevention Habits</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Hand washing, surface cleaning, mask use, and other proven methods to reduce flu transmission.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Learn habits →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/prevention/immune-support/" class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md hover:border-teal-200 transition-all group">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💪</span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-navy-800 group-hover:text-teal-600 transition-colors">Immune System Support</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Sleep, nutrition, exercise, and stress management — evidence-based ways to strengthen your immune system.</p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-teal-600 font-medium text-sm">Boost immunity →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
